    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "To obtain a description of the genetic components of covariance between relatives, we will adhere to the usual assumptions of gametic phase equilibrium and random mating. Recalling Equation 7.12, the genetic covariance due to direct effects is",
      "source_page": 702,
      "printed_page": 682,
      "source_block_ids": [
