    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $ \\Theta_{xy} $ and $ \\Delta_{xy} $ are the coefficients of coancestry and fraternity for individuals x and y, and $ \\sigma_{A_o}^2 $ and $ \\sigma_{D_o}^2 $ are the additive and dominance components of variance involving direct genetic effects. The next two genetic covariance terms in Equation 23.2 can be expanded by noting that they involve the direct genetic effects of one individual and the maternal genetic effects contributed by the mother of the second individual,",
