    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Table 23.1 summarizes the coefficients for the different causal components of variance and covariance that contribute to the phenotypic covariances between several types of relatives. Expressions for many other kinds of relatives are given by Willham (1963, 1972), Eisen (1967), and Thompson (1976).",
      "source_page": 702,
      "printed_page": 682,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter23:p004:b14"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        138.0,
